    "reason": "no_positive_contested_labels: the fixture carries 6 pseudo_contradiction records, every one curator-adjudicated NOT a contradiction, and 0 records labelled as a genuine contradiction. Contested recall and precision are therefore unmeasurable against this corpus; only the false-positive count below is a measurement."
